/** *`SO_REUSEADDR`, so a restarted server binds its port while old */
/** *connections sit in `TIME_WAIT`. Not on Windows, where it would let */
/** *another process bind the same port: Windows binds over `TIME_WAIT` */
/** *without it. */
#[os("posix")]
